## 📖 About the Project

**PediatricNurseCare** is a lightweight, single-page landing site built for a client — an independent pediatric nurse — to present her professional profile and provide an easy way for patients and families to get in touch.

The site was built entirely in **Vanilla JavaScript**, with no frameworks or external libraries: fast to load, easy to maintain, and simple to deploy anywhere.

**Key features:**

- 👩‍⚕️ Professional presentation section
- 📩 Direct contact section
- 📱 Fully responsive design (mobile / tablet / desktop)
- ⚡ Zero-dependency, framework-free build

