## ⚙️ Getting Started

No build tools or dependencies required — it's plain HTML/CSS/JS.

### Prerequisites

- A modern web browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge)
- Git (to clone the repo)

### Installation

```bash
# 1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/NietoDeveloper/PediatricNurseCare.git

# 2. Navigate into the project directory
cd PediatricNurseCare
```

### Run locally

Simply open `index.html` in your browser — no server or install step needed.

```bash
open index.html
```

